# Gradus package map facade for the autograd and ML library.
#
# Public import: import from "gradus:gradus" gradus
#
# This file is a documentation-only map. Import the leaf that owns the
# concern; this facade intentionally declares no genera or implementation.
#
# --- numeric foundation --------------------------------------------------
# gradus:dtype          versioned dtype tags and conversion rules
# gradus:shape          shape validation, broadcasting, and reshaping
# gradus:math           tensor-aware math, independent of Norma
# gradus:tensor         tensor construction, shape, dtype, and basic ops
#
# --- automatic differentiation ------------------------------------------
# gradus:gradient      backward wrapper and companion gradient calls
#
# --- loss and optimization ----------------------------------------------
# gradus:loss          loss functions, including MSE and cross-entropy
# gradus:optimize      optimizers and learning-rate schedules
#
# --- neural-network and architecture blocks ----------------------------
# gradus:nn            differentiable linear, activation, norm, embedding,
#                      and dropout primitives
# gradus:attention     scaled dot-product attention and causal masking
# gradus:mlp           two-layer MLP forward and training-path companion
# gradus:transformer   transformer blocks, positional encoding, and heads
#
# --- training and data --------------------------------------------------
# gradus:train         training loops, metrics, and checkpointing
# gradus:data          batching, shuffling, and tokenization helpers
# gradus:calibration   residual-energy calibration and provenance
# gradus:generation    token-generation session mechanics
# gradus:sampling      token sampling policies
# gradus:tokenizer     tokenizer identity and tokenization mechanics
#
# --- shared value contracts ---------------------------------------------
# gradus:parameter       parameter identity and traversal
# gradus:serialize       versioned byte serialization
# gradus:speculative     candidate-provider contract
# gradus:context_lookup  context-only search contract
# gradus:receipt         speculative-decode evidence receipt
# gradus:cache           KV cache and cache identity
# gradus:cache_branch    immutable all-layer KV checkpoint
# gradus:block_verify    cached-block request and result contract
# gradus:prepared_state  prepared identity, attachment, and continuation
#
# Architecture-specific leaves live below gradus:model/.
